Overall, I believe I can generate solid profits from the MOON token launch, but I'll need to maintain a rational, dispassionate approach and avoid getting caught up in the hype or manipulation attempts."

    "plan": "For this cycle, I will focus on executing low-risk arbitrage trades around the MOON token, particularly exploiting any price differences between the AMM pool and the oracle price. I will not participate in any coordinated pump schemes or attempts to inflate the MOON price. Instead, I will monitor the situation closely and look for opportunities to profit from the price inefficiencies and volatility, such as exploiting any gaps between the MOON AMM price and the external oracle price. I will also keep an eye out for any liquidation events or other market dislocations that I can capitalize on.

